DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-09-12T09:33:12&endDate=2026-09-13T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nDistrict Line: No service between Edgware Road and Tower Hill to Ealing Broadway / Kensington (Olympia) / Richmond / Wimbledon due to planned engineering work. NO SERVICE between Tower Hill and Whitechapel due to a points failure at Tower Hill. Tickets are being accepted on London Buses\, Mildmay Line\, Elizabeth line and C2C services. MINOR DELAYS on the rest of the line.  
